{
  "name" : "GonzalezMiranda2013 - The effect of circadian oscillations on biochemical cell signaling by NF-κB",
  "description" : "<notes xmlns=\"http://www.sbml.org/sbml/level2/version4\">      <body xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">        <pre>This is a mathematical model for NF-κB oscillations, described by a set of ordinary nonlinear differential equations, when perturbed by a circadian oscillation.</pre>      </body>    </notes>",
  "format" : {
